# Brings a fresh Claude Code session to an empty prompt. Include it first in a step file whose
# command is `claude ...`.
#
# A directory Claude Code hasn't seen asks whether to trust it first. Keys sent before that
# dialog takes input land on "No, exit", so wait a moment before moving to "Yes".
wait 'trust this folder|❯' 60
when 'trust this folder' sleep 1.5
when 'trust this folder' keys Down
when 'trust this folder' wait '❯ Yes, I trust' 10
when '❯ Yes, I trust' keys Enter
wait '❯' 60
sleep 1
